{"alias":"/learning/multilinguallearner/resources/toolkit","title":"ESOL Programs Toolkit","changed":"2026-09-15T14:57:10+00:00","before":"<p><img alt=\"Multilingual Learners Resources Banner\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"55417128-70ff-4d2e-823e-02e2198bde9d\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Multilingual%20Learners%20-%20Resources%20Web%20Banner.png\" width=\"100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Explore Maine Department of Education's tools and resources designed to help districts build coherent, integrated multilingual learner programs. The collection brings together practical guidance and tools that support aligned systems, shared responsibility, and responsive practices across programming, instruction, family engagement, and student support. Resources are designed to help districts meet regulatory requirements while addressing the unique needs of multilingual learners.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This dynamic resource hub is updated regularly with new tools, information, and resources reflecting current research and best practices. Adapt and build upon these tools to develop coherent approaches that reflect the diverse needs of your community.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\">\r\n<h2>Tools for Coherent, Integrated Multilingual Learner Programs</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Templates and Guidance</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"ac54956e-926f-4a43-a564-df8f984806fc\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/multilingual%20learner%20-%20sau%20program%20self%20assessment%20-%2010.23.2024.pdf\">SAU Multilingual Program Self-Assessment</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"8ac42b9b-42d4-4377-8b62-1e0c052af5bc\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20LAU%20Plan%20Framework%20-%2010.28.2025.pdf\">Maine DOE Lau Plan Template and Guidance</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/DATA%20-%20Multilingual%20Learner%20Data%20-%202.24.2026.pdf\">Student Enrollment Guide: ML Data Upload and Reporting Checklist</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a6180d5a-2579-4c7c-8efb-32831bbaa27f\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/EL%20Program%20Types.pdf\">ESOL/Bilingual Program Types for State Data Collection</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20ILAP%20Companion%20Guide%20-%208.7.2026.pdf\">Maine DOE Individual Language Acquisition Plan (ILAP) Companion Guide</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Individual Language Acquisition Plan (ILAP) Template 2.0 – Fillable <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20ILAP%20Template%20-%208.7.2026.pdf\">PDF</a> and <a href=\"https://view.officeapps.live.com/op/view.aspx?src=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.maine.gov%2Fdoe%2Fsites%2Fmaine.gov.doe%2Ffiles%2Finline-files%2FMultilingual%2520Learning%2520-%2520ILAP%2520Template%2520-%25208.7.2026.docx&amp;wdOrigin=BROWSELINK\">Word</a> templates</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"d0d472a8-dfb4-400c-b853-d7212365fcb0\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilinugal%20Learning%20-%20Secondary%20Programming%20%26%20Grade%20Placement%20Guidance%20-%2010.17.2025.pdf\">Programming and Grade Placement Guidance for Multilingual Learners Transitioning to Maine High Schools</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Identifying%20%26%20Serving%20Students%20Who%20are%20Multilingual%20with%20Disabilities%20Policy%20%26%20Resource%20Guide%20-%204.14.2025.pdf\">Identifying and Serving Students Who Are Multilingual Learners with Disabilities: Policy and Resource Guide</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"0f58c33b-90bc-4c60-8ddd-bfc19543f705\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Pre-K%20Service%20Provision%20Guidelines.pdf\">ESOL Service Provision Guidelines for Dual Language Learners in Pre-K</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>English Learner Toolkit</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<div class=\"row align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 py-2 text-center\"><img alt=\"English Learner Toolkit cover\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f10c5f27-4199-4afa-b236-005dd7b8fda7\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20US%20DOE%20English%20Language%20Toolkit%20Cover%20Image%20-%208.13.2026.png\" style=\"max-height:280px; width:auto; max-width:100%; border:1px solid #d6dce2; border-radius:6px;\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-8 py-2\">\r\n<p>The <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20US%20DOE%20English%20Learner%20Toolkit%20-%209.26.2025.pdf\">English Learner Toolkit</a> by the National Clearinghouse for English Language Acquisition (NCELA) supports state and local education agencies in meeting their obligations to English Learners (ELs) under U.S. civil rights laws. It offers 10 chapters, each covering a key area such as identifying ELs, providing language assistance programs, ensuring access to curricula, supporting ELs with disabilities, and communicating with parents. Each chapter includes tools and resources to help educators effectively support ELs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a class=\"btn btn-info btn-lg btn-block\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20US%20DOE%20English%20Learner%20Toolkit%20-%209.26.2025.pdf\">Download the English Learner Toolkit</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Family Engagement and Notifications</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"1361d61b-b2bf-4933-9482-47bf112341e9\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Sample%20Multilingual%20Newcomer%20Intake%20Interview%20Form.docx\">Sample Multilingual Family Education and History Enrollment Interview Form</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"90e90d13-b67f-44c2-a4d4-9d4dbea5173a\" filename=\"Multilingual Learning - Sample ESOL Eligibility Parent Notification Form - 9.14.26.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Sample%20ESOL%20Eligibility%20Parent%20Notification%20Form%20-%209.14.26.docx\">Sample Multilingual Learner Eligibility Parent Notification Form</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f766b535-9ef8-403b-aefc-631a8c1f5cc8\" filename=\"Multilingual Learning - Sample ESOL Non-Eligibility Parent Notification Form K-12 - 9.14.26.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Sample%20ESOL%20Non-Eligibility%20Parent%20Notification%20Form%20K-12%20-%209.14.26.docx\">Sample&nbsp;Multilingual Learner Non-Eligibility Parent Notification Form</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"542a8888-fd1c-4019-8ff4-c32ae712dc40\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Sample%20Parent%20Notification%20to%20Decline%20Services%20-%2010.28.2025.pdf\">Sample Parent/Guardian Form to Decline ESOL Services</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"046413f2-84aa-4dc6-8cd7-2bc65e297a1b\" filename=\"Multilingual Learning - Sample Parent Guardian Notice of Exit from ESOL Program - 9.11.26.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Sample%20Parent%20Guardian%20Notice%20of%20Exit%20from%20ESOL%20Program%20-%209.11.26.docx\">Sample Parent/Guardian Notice of Exit from ESOL Program</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Program Resources</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://wida.wisc.edu/teach/standards/eld\">WIDA English Language Development Standards</a> and <a href=\"https://wida.wisc.edu/\">resources</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/multilinguallearner/resources/instruction\">Building Capacity for Multilingual Learners with SupportEd</a> Professional Learning Series</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/pineproject\">PINE Project Book Collection and Professional Learning Modules</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.projectlee.org/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/PL_booklet_PLUSS.pdf\">PLUSS: Framework for Instructional/Intervention Enhancement: Observation Rubric Project LEE</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"abcb804d-9ac0-47fe-afaa-053a3b3c2dc5\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Making%20Meaning%20Expressive%20and%20Interpretative%20Considerations%20-%204.28.2025.pdf\">Making Meaning: Expressive and Interpretative Considerations for Multilingual Learners</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"24ce3518-2a71-45b8-9c69-e417afb597f3\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Beyond%20the%20Surface%20Stages%20of%20Language%20Acquisition%20-%204.28.2025.pdf\">Beyond the Surface: Stages of Language Acquisition</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Orientation Checklist for New Multilingual Students – <a href=\"https://youtu.be/cZWJ4O8qv1c?si=SYxAuB4e4Dcht_Yq\">Video</a> | <a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"fba05bb4-9591-4abc-bb55-3451bfdc6e3c\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/multilingual%20-%20Orientation%20Checklist%20for%20New%20Multilingual%20Students%20to%20Your%20School%20-%2012.3.2024.pdf\">One-Pager</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Dual Language Learners PreK – <a href=\"https://youtu.be/GecFBhUTy54?si=-13JXU8Swaws3nKg\">Video</a> | <a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"cdba357d-d265-4232-9fe4-8b00f77067ca\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/multilingual%20-%20Dual%20Language%20Learners%20Infographic%20-%2012.3.2024.pdf\">One-Pager</a> | <a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"740d73b1-82dd-4729-8554-a5ed768a9b2e\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/multilingual%20-%20Dual%20Language%20Learners%20PreK%20PPT%20-%2012.3.2024.pdf\">Presentation</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Multilingual Learners with Disabilities Policy and Resource Guide: Intervention Procedures – <a href=\"https://youtu.be/dOzCqSZZ8JY?si=VmGV91c4CDEBiI7c\">Video</a> | <a data-entity-substitution=\"file\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"5e4014e5-eb55-4955-8611-68566f738135\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Serving%20MLs%20with%20Disabilities%20Policy%20%26%20Resource%20Guidance%20-%205.6.2025.pdf\">One-Pager</a> | <a data-entity-substitution=\"file\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"cb911957-371a-4cde-b392-19908f2574ff\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20MTSS-RTI%20Checklist%20-%204.15.2025.pdf\">MTSS/RTI Checklist</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c5331629-02d6-4c6a-86cb-46ea8ec593af\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Cultural%20Reading%20Resources%20for%20Educators.pdf\">Cultural Reading Resources for Educators</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.uniteforliteracy.com/\">Unite for Literacy</a>: Free digital access to picture books narrated in 50+ languages.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Communication and Support Tools</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"37a1a6e1-6480-49e2-8aa7-e4efe989856d\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Progress%20Monitoring%20Document%20Example%20for%20Exited%20MLs.pdf\">Progress Monitoring Document Example for Exited Multilingual Learners</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"e5920831-b1e6-492d-9828-fed10d6fd27b\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Communication%20Cards_0.pdf\">Newcomer Student Communication Cards</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"4b6baa98-f4e5-443a-a67d-15a80e8563ed\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Sample%20Newcomer%20Flashcards%20%28English%20to%20Pashto%29%20by%20Education%20for%20All.pdf\">Sample Newcomer Flashcards (English to Pashto) by Education for All</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Student Schedules</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"074c0f68-95b6-436f-af57-63d04c66aa4d\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Guidance%20on%20Sample%20Student%20Schedules_1.pdf\">Guidance on Sample Student Schedules</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"b4434c5e-67e9-47e0-ab94-ea71d47c38d3\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/1.0-2.9%20Sample%20Student%20Schedules%20vf_0.pdf\">WIDA ELP Level 1.0-2.9 Sample Student Schedule</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c0d3c6cf-16b6-4e9e-a549-c857f4b78887\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/3.0-3.9%20Sample%20Student%20Schedule%20vf_0.pdf\">WIDA ELP Level 3.0-3.9 Sample Student Schedule</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"b0a771c6-97f3-465f-892b-504ec21e7541\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/4.0-4.5%20Sample%20Student%20Schedules%20vf_0.pdf\">WIDA ELP Level 4.0-4.5 Sample Student Schedule</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\">\r\n<h2>Access to Achievement: iMTSS Supporting ALL Learners at Every Tier</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p><strong>Equitable Access. Meaningful Engagement. Growth for All.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Integrated Multi-Tiered Systems of Support (iMTSS) is a proactive, data-driven framework that combines academic, behavioral, and social-emotional supports to ensure every student, including multilingual learners (MLs), gets the right support at the right time. Tier 1 serves as the foundation, emphasizing culturally and linguistically responsive instruction, language and content objectives, and collaborative planning. Progress is closely monitored, and when needed, targeted Tier 2 or Tier 3 interventions are added through a team-based process.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.mtss4els.org/\">Multi-tiered System of Supports for English Learners</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"050bd240-ecc1-48f2-b5e4-0943a5f16221\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20MTSS%20Recommended%20Support%20-%203.10.2026.pdf\">Integrated Multi-tiered Systems of Support &amp; Multilingual Learners Flyer</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3><strong>Contact</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Jane Armstrong</strong><br />\r\n<em>ESOL State Specialist</em><br />\r\n<strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:jane.armstrong@maine.gov\">Jane.Armstrong@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-eyebrow\">Multilingual Programming Resources</p>\n<p class=\"doe-contact-link\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-lead\">Explore Maine Department of Education's tools and resources designed to help districts build coherent, integrated multilingual learner programs. The collection brings together practical guidance and tools that support aligned systems, shared responsibility, and responsive practices across programming, instruction, family engagement, and student support. Resources are designed to help districts meet regulatory requirements while addressing the unique needs of multilingual learners.</p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>This dynamic resource hub is updated regularly with new tools, information, and resources reflecting current research and best practices. Adapt and build upon these tools to develop coherent approaches that reflect the diverse needs of your community.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"tools-for-coherent-integrated-multilingual-learn\">\r\n<h2>Tools for Coherent, Integrated Multilingual Learner Programs</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Templates and Guidance</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/multilingual%20learner%20-%20sau%20program%20self%20assessment%20-%2010.23.2024.pdf\">SAU Multilingual Program Self-Assessment</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20LAU%20Plan%20Framework%20-%2010.28.2025.pdf\">Maine DOE Lau Plan Template and Guidance</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/DATA%20-%20Multilingual%20Learner%20Data%20-%202.24.2026.pdf\">Student Enrollment Guide: ML Data Upload and Reporting Checklist</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/EL%20Program%20Types.pdf\">ESOL/Bilingual Program Types for State Data Collection</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20ILAP%20Companion%20Guide%20-%208.7.2026.pdf\">Maine DOE Individual Language Acquisition Plan (ILAP) Companion Guide</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Individual Language Acquisition Plan (ILAP) Template 2.0 – Fillable <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20ILAP%20Template%20-%208.7.2026.pdf\">PDF</a> and <a href=\"https://view.officeapps.live.com/op/view.aspx?src=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.maine.gov%2Fdoe%2Fsites%2Fmaine.gov.doe%2Ffiles%2Finline-files%2FMultilingual%2520Learning%2520-%2520ILAP%2520Template%2520-%25208.7.2026.docx&amp;wdOrigin=BROWSELINK\" target=\"_blank\">Word</a> templates</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilinugal%20Learning%20-%20Secondary%20Programming%20%26%20Grade%20Placement%20Guidance%20-%2010.17.2025.pdf\">Programming and Grade Placement Guidance for Multilingual Learners Transitioning to Maine High Schools</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Identifying%20%26%20Serving%20Students%20Who%20are%20Multilingual%20with%20Disabilities%20Policy%20%26%20Resource%20Guide%20-%204.14.2025.pdf\">Identifying and Serving Students Who Are Multilingual Learners with Disabilities: Policy and Resource Guide</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Pre-K%20Service%20Provision%20Guidelines.pdf\">ESOL Service Provision Guidelines for Dual Language Learners in Pre-K</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>English Learner Toolkit</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<div class=\"row align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 py-2 text-center\"><img alt=\"English Learner Toolkit cover\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20US%20DOE%20English%20Language%20Toolkit%20Cover%20Image%20-%208.13.2026.png\" style=\"border:1px solid #d6dce2; border-radius:6px\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-8 py-2\">\r\n<p>The <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20US%20DOE%20English%20Learner%20Toolkit%20-%209.26.2025.pdf\">English Learner Toolkit</a> by the National Clearinghouse for English Language Acquisition (NCELA) supports state and local education agencies in meeting their obligations to English Learners (ELs) under U.S. civil rights laws. It offers 10 chapters, each covering a key area such as identifying ELs, providing language assistance programs, ensuring access to curricula, supporting ELs with disabilities, and communicating with parents. Each chapter includes tools and resources to help educators effectively support ELs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a class=\"btn btn-info btn-lg btn-block\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20US%20DOE%20English%20Learner%20Toolkit%20-%209.26.2025.pdf\">Download the English Learner Toolkit</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Family Engagement and Notifications</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Sample%20Multilingual%20Newcomer%20Intake%20Interview%20Form.docx\">Sample Multilingual Family Education and History Enrollment Interview Form</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Sample%20ESOL%20Eligibility%20Parent%20Notification%20Form%20-%209.14.26.docx\">Sample Multilingual Learner Eligibility Parent Notification Form</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Sample%20ESOL%20Non-Eligibility%20Parent%20Notification%20Form%20K-12%20-%209.14.26.docx\">Sample&nbsp;Multilingual Learner Non-Eligibility Parent Notification Form</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Sample%20Parent%20Notification%20to%20Decline%20Services%20-%2010.28.2025.pdf\">Sample Parent/Guardian Form to Decline ESOL Services</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Sample%20Parent%20Guardian%20Notice%20of%20Exit%20from%20ESOL%20Program%20-%209.11.26.docx\">Sample Parent/Guardian Notice of Exit from ESOL Program</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Program Resources</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://wida.wisc.edu/teach/standards/eld\" target=\"_blank\">WIDA English Language Development Standards</a> and <a href=\"https://wida.wisc.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">resources</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/multilinguallearner/resources/instruction\">Building Capacity for Multilingual Learners with SupportEd</a> Professional Learning Series</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/pineproject\">PINE Project Book Collection and Professional Learning Modules</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.projectlee.org/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/PL_booklet_PLUSS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PLUSS: Framework for Instructional/Intervention Enhancement: Observation Rubric Project LEE</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Making%20Meaning%20Expressive%20and%20Interpretative%20Considerations%20-%204.28.2025.pdf\">Making Meaning: Expressive and Interpretative Considerations for Multilingual Learners</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Beyond%20the%20Surface%20Stages%20of%20Language%20Acquisition%20-%204.28.2025.pdf\">Beyond the Surface: Stages of Language Acquisition</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Orientation Checklist for New Multilingual Students – <a href=\"https://youtu.be/cZWJ4O8qv1c?si=SYxAuB4e4Dcht_Yq\" target=\"_blank\">Video</a> | <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/multilingual%20-%20Orientation%20Checklist%20for%20New%20Multilingual%20Students%20to%20Your%20School%20-%2012.3.2024.pdf\">One-Pager</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Dual Language Learners PreK – <a href=\"https://youtu.be/GecFBhUTy54?si=-13JXU8Swaws3nKg\" target=\"_blank\">Video</a> | <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/multilingual%20-%20Dual%20Language%20Learners%20Infographic%20-%2012.3.2024.pdf\">One-Pager</a> | <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/multilingual%20-%20Dual%20Language%20Learners%20PreK%20PPT%20-%2012.3.2024.pdf\">Presentation</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Multilingual Learners with Disabilities Policy and Resource Guide: Intervention Procedures – <a href=\"https://youtu.be/dOzCqSZZ8JY?si=VmGV91c4CDEBiI7c\" target=\"_blank\">Video</a> | <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20Serving%20MLs%20with%20Disabilities%20Policy%20%26%20Resource%20Guidance%20-%205.6.2025.pdf\">One-Pager</a> | <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20MTSS-RTI%20Checklist%20-%204.15.2025.pdf\">MTSS/RTI Checklist</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Cultural%20Reading%20Resources%20for%20Educators.pdf\">Cultural Reading Resources for Educators</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item list-group-item\"><a class=\"doe-noarrow\" href=\"https://www.uniteforliteracy.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unite for Literacy</a>: Free digital access to picture books narrated in 50+ languages.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Communication and Support Tools</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Progress%20Monitoring%20Document%20Example%20for%20Exited%20MLs.pdf\">Progress Monitoring Document Example for Exited Multilingual Learners</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Communication%20Cards_0.pdf\">Newcomer Student Communication Cards</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Sample%20Newcomer%20Flashcards%20%28English%20to%20Pashto%29%20by%20Education%20for%20All.pdf\">Sample Newcomer Flashcards (English to Pashto) by Education for All</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Student Schedules</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Guidance%20on%20Sample%20Student%20Schedules_1.pdf\">Guidance on Sample Student Schedules</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/1.0-2.9%20Sample%20Student%20Schedules%20vf_0.pdf\">WIDA ELP Level 1.0-2.9 Sample Student Schedule</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/3.0-3.9%20Sample%20Student%20Schedule%20vf_0.pdf\">WIDA ELP Level 3.0-3.9 Sample Student Schedule</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/4.0-4.5%20Sample%20Student%20Schedules%20vf_0.pdf\">WIDA ELP Level 4.0-4.5 Sample Student Schedule</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"access-to-achievement-imtss-supporting-all-learn\">\r\n<h2>Access to Achievement: iMTSS Supporting ALL Learners at Every Tier</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p><strong>Equitable Access. Meaningful Engagement. Growth for All.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Integrated Multi-Tiered Systems of Support (iMTSS) is a proactive, data-driven framework that combines academic, behavioral, and social-emotional supports to ensure every student, including multilingual learners (MLs), gets the right support at the right time. Tier 1 serves as the foundation, emphasizing culturally and linguistically responsive instruction, language and content objectives, and collaborative planning. Progress is closely monitored, and when needed, targeted Tier 2 or Tier 3 interventions are added through a team-based process.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.mtss4els.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Multi-tiered System of Supports for English Learners</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Multilingual%20Learning%20-%20MTSS%20Recommended%20Support%20-%203.10.2026.pdf\">Integrated Multi-tiered Systems of Support &amp; Multilingual Learners Flyer</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"contact\" class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3>Contact</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Jane Armstrong</strong><br />\r\n<em>ESOL State Specialist</em><br />\r\n<strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:jane.armstrong@maine.gov\">Jane.Armstrong@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-jump\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":["2 section headers — too few for a contents list."],"decisions":[{"id":"filechip","on":true,"label":"Tag a document link with the format it opens","why":"4 links on this page open a file — 4 Word — and say nothing about it, while others in the same list carry a tag because their author typed one. The format is read from the file name, so the list stops being half-labelled. No link text changes.","value":"4 links"},{"id":"items","on":true,"label":"Separate a link from its description","why":"1 list item opens with a link and then explain it, all at the same weight — so the thing you can click is no easier to find than the sentence about it. The link becomes the item and the explanation sits under it.","value":"1 item"},{"id":"leadcolon","on":true,"label":"Let a colon do its own work","why":"A colon marks the words before it as a term and the words after it as what the term means. 1 link sits immediately in front of a colon, where the chevron lands between the term and the punctuation that belongs to it. No word changes and nothing is removed.","value":"1 chevron dropped"},{"id":"deck","on":true,"label":"Use this paragraph as the page description","why":"It is the page’s own opening paragraph, moved into the banner rather than rewritten.","value":"Explore Maine Department of Education's tools and resources designed to help districts build coherent, integrated multilingual learner programs. The collection brings together practical guidance and tools that support aligned systems, shared responsibility, and responsive practices across programming, instruction, family engagement, and student support. Resources are designed to help districts meet regulatory requirements while addressing the unique needs of multilingual learners."},{"id":"banner-graphic","on":true,"label":"Retire the old banner graphic","why":"It repeats the page title in picture form, which the new banner already does in type.","removes":"Multilingual Learners - Resources Web Banner.png"},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"